[{"title":"庚戌八月二十二日恭闻奉天殿视朝","author":"谢榛","text":"上苑凉飔起，西山瑞霭浓。\n玉珂天汉路，金阙午时钟。\n剑佩炉香近，旌旗日影重。\n宫墙落杨柳，水槛出芙蓉。\n万舞趋丹凤，千官识衮龙。\n遥传北伐诏，光耀紫泥封。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6394,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送汪郎中伯阳出守北地","author":"谢榛","text":"五马冲寒色，冰霜满去程。\n君王忧北地，父老望前旌。\n典郡才方振，防年计不轻。\n河山分陕服，形势辅咸京。\n树隐青蛇庙，天空白豹城。\n人家尽周俗，羌笛半秦声。\n夜月登楼啸，春风露冕行。\n试看《循吏传》，终古定垂名。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6395,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送赵太守还任淮安","author":"谢榛","text":"相思隔楚树，相聚复燕州。\n五马翻成别，孤樽不可留。\n江河自襟带，南北此咽喉。\n昭代今多事，苍生日隐忧。\n几时堪卧治，何处薄征求。\n海上寒涛息，天边春气流。\n花明射阳水，月满镇淮楼。\n地胜多名士，何人托乘游。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6396,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"初春夜集王元美宅饯别吴峻伯徐汝思袁履善三比部出使得杯字","author":"谢榛","text":"共饯江南客，芳筵候月来。\n漏催诗草就，春报烛花开。\n把袂终千里，论心更一杯。\n风人今夜聚，星使几时回。\n官舍遥闻笛，宫庭暗落梅。\n相看倍惆怅，残雪照燕台。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6397,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄孔方伯汝锡","author":"谢榛","text":"每忆汾阳约，何为代北游。\n神交太行迥，调合建安流。\n高步云随杖，穷边雪照楼。\n虏骄轻出入，吾老重淹留。\n厚禄惟思报，严兵只御秋。\n材官几人在，国士百年忧。\n上古元无战，中丞自有谋。\n冰清闲鹤渚，潭冷闭龙湫。\n旧社独来去，春醪那唱酬。\n相逢话时事，感慨望神州。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6398,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送高伯宗梁公实二比部祭陵庙","author":"谢榛","text":"祀典千年重，严趋二妙同。\n马嘶川日堕，路转石林通。\n旌旆晴光外，山陵王气中。\n云深罗俎豆，霜下肃臣工。\n明月帝灵在，高秋天宇空。\n瞻依增百感，松槚正悲风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6399,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠董职方德甫擢光禄卿","author":"谢榛","text":"三秋心力尽，经略见才雄。\n董策今谁在，班铭志已同。\n才收卫律叛，更赏霍家功。\n神武惟龙准，凭陵自犬戎。\n兵张群议后，官转百忧中。\n侯火惊燕甸，宵衣想汉宫。\n将星寒动塞，卿月夜临空。\n尚忆长征子，持戈向北风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6400,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄塞上王侍御子梁","author":"谢榛","text":"君王重简命，尔志在澄清。\n节钺分西顾，风云护北征。\n羽旗荒外合，骢马雪中行。\n直渡桑乾水，还临骠骑营。\n九关多猛士，百战有长城。\n夜半仍传檄，天寒未解兵。\n黑山横宝剑，青海动金钲。\n独仗防边策，兼收抗疏名。\n虚心当国事，高议见儒生。\n壮岁思铭鼎，空言陋请缨。\n乘秋摧虏气，计日答皇情。\n应遣龙庭使，驰书到玉京。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6401,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江南曲","author":"谢榛","text":"夹岸多垂杨，妾家临野塘。\n手拈青杏子，不忍打鸳鸯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6402,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江南曲二首 其二","author":"谢榛","text":"夹岸多杨柳，妾家近塘口。\n中有断肠花，郎君不回首。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6403,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"怀邹子序","author":"谢榛","text":"渺渺太湖水，湖中多鲤鱼。\n故人时把钓，应有北来书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6404,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"都下别张志虞","author":"谢榛","text":"十年今一见，话旧却成悲。\n共醉新丰酒，天涯又别离。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6405,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"行路难","author":"谢榛","text":"荀卿将入楚，范叔未归秦。\n花鸟非乡国，悠悠行路人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6406,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游天坛山 其三","author":"谢榛","text":"偶逢双玉童，相引蹑云去。\n犬吠洞门开，三花最深处。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6407,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"初春夜同漫山方伯琼泉将军酌樗庵书斋","author":"谢榛","text":"客子灯前酒，梅花雪后天。\n不须横玉笛，春意满山川。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6408,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春柳","author":"谢榛","text":"嫩色含轻雨，柔丝弄早春。\n昏鸦栖欲定，肠断未归人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6409,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春兴","author":"谢榛","text":"夜月悬银烛，春江湛绿醅。\n美人歌古调，烂醉百花台。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6410,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"塞下曲二首 其一","author":"谢榛","text":"飘蓬燕赵间，行李风霜下。\n芦管送边声，空林一驻马。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6411,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"塞下曲二首 其二","author":"谢榛","text":"塞上黄须儿，饮马黑山涧。\n弯弧向朔云，莫射南飞雁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6412,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"潞阳晓访冯员外汝言 其一","author":"谢榛","text":"海日上孤帆，山云交杂树。\n美人方晓眠，更在林深处。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6413,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"潞阳晓访冯员外汝言 其二","author":"谢榛","text":"野阔早霜明，林空凉吹动。\n一犬吠人来，松窗破秋梦。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6414,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏蝉","author":"谢榛","text":"弱翅凌晨动，繁声向夕流。\n不知风露里，还得几何秋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6415,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雪后同王希元登代州城楼 其二","author":"谢榛","text":"睥睨胡天近，登临边树迷。\n汉兵不到处，寒鸟向谁啼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6416,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雪后登代州城楼时虏犯岢岚三首 其二","author":"谢榛","text":"霁色分诸垒，寒空下一雕。\n幕南白草尽，胡马亦何骄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6417,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雪后登代州城楼时虏犯岢岚三首 其三","author":"谢榛","text":"都门飞羽书，冰雪走胡骑。\n只见塞云愁，那知塞垣事。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6418,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春雪登楼有感","author":"谢榛","text":"天垂楼外云，雪变城中树。\n何处不春寒，鸦啼又飞去。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6419,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"东园秋怀二首 其一","author":"谢榛","text":"花竹可消愁，愁来独上楼。\n自古天涯客，谁禁老去秋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6420,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"东园秋怀 其二","author":"谢榛","text":"天寒闻落木，叶叶是乡愁。\n敲窗作风雨，不减去年秋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6421,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登辉县城见卫水思归","author":"谢榛","text":"城外河流白练长，城中万户共秋光。\n秋来偏作还家梦，河水东流到故乡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6422,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"塞上曲 其二","author":"谢榛","text":"旌旗荡野塞云开，金鼓连天朔雁回。\n落日半山追黠虏，弯弓直过李陵台。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f