"author":"谢榛","text":"高枝带雨压雕栏，一蒂千花白玉团。\n怪杀芳心春历乱，捲帘谁向月中看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6436,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"采莲曲","author":"谢榛","text":"湖上西风吹绮罗，靓妆越女照清波。\n折将莲叶佯遮面，棹过前滩笑语多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6437,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋怀","author":"谢榛","text":"秋来客思渺烟波，湖上看山秋更多。\n祇恐佳人怨秋色，晚风吹断采菱歌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6438,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春词 其二","author":"谢榛","text":"城乌何意夜深啼，红杏梢头片月低。\n香冷熏笼人不寐，春风吹过玉栏西。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6439,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春闺","author":"谢榛","text":"罗衣初试薄寒生，豆蔻花开感别情。\n零落铅华君不见，画楼春雨燕双鸣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6440,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"重九雨中怀弟","author":"谢榛","text":"天空朔雁不成行，秋色年年似故乡。\n门掩菊花人独卧，冷风疏雨过重阳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6441,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"塞上曲寄少司马苏允吉 其二","author":"谢榛","text":"白登城上早霜凄，黑水河边暮雁低。\n还忆去秋明月下，胡笳吹过七陵西。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6442,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"即席赠薛之翰","author":"谢榛","text":"园花樽酒日相期，共尔留连欲暮时。\n醉倚山亭歌楚调，秋萤飞过石榴枝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6443,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"愚公园春酌二首 其一","author":"谢榛","text":"共醉春风且放情，白云无定若浮名。\n好花开落寻常事，遮莫黄鹂不住声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6444,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"愚公园春酌二首 其二","author":"谢榛","text":"绛桃一簇映斜晖，白首寻芳几醉归。\n更有多情双蛱蝶，春来还傍菜花飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6445,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春怨","author":"谢榛","text":"紫绡挥断泪阑干，窗下秦筝独自弹。\n三月梨花风又雨，小楼燕子怯春寒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6446,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春宫词","author":"谢榛","text":"御河桥畔是侬家，一入深宫虚岁华。\n别院黄昏吹凤管，月钩斜照刺桐花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6447,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宫词 其一","author":"谢榛","text":"自入长门空绣帷，玉颜非复镜中时。\n梨花夜雨灯相对，燕子春寒君不知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6448,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宫词 其二","author":"谢榛","text":"晓起慵妆眉黛残，玉阶芳草捲帘看。\n花间漫扑双蝴蝶，宿露偏沾翠袖寒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6449,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"明月山下逢武宾相克仁话旧","author":"谢榛","text":"车马西来自泽州，思君不见十经秋。\n相逢把袂成悲感，明月当前两白头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6450,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"暮鸦有感","author":"谢榛","text":"来时池草吐春芽，秋水惊心落藕花。\n空记三秋故乡梦，夕阳衰柳看归鸦。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6451,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"金笳曲 其一","author":"谢榛","text":"砂碛茫茫黑水流，胡儿六月换羊裘。\n骆驼背上吹芦管，风散龙荒作冷秋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6452,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"九日过王叔野无菊","author":"谢榛","text":"陶潜懒慢闭柴关，九日餐英自解颜。\n不种黄花君更懒，满城秋色几人闲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6453,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"访葛徵君","author":"谢榛","text":"西城閒访葛洪家，篱落秋馀白豆花。\n高枕自知无俗梦，数椽茅屋在烟霞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6454,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄武当山张隐君 其一","author":"谢榛","text":"辞官身寄楚天涯，石屋烧丹别是家。\n七十二峰春雪里，杖藜随意看梅花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6455,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晚登沁州城有感 其一","author":"谢榛","text":"苍茫野色几沙滩，漳水东流倚堞看。\n烟火满城天向夕，一雕飞过不知寒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6456,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"塞下曲 其二","author":"谢榛","text":"青海城边秋草稀，黄沙碛里夜云飞。\n将军不寐听刁斗，月上辕门探马归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6457,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"漠北词 其二","author":"谢榛","text":"委羽山横塞北天，学飞雏雁夕阳边。\n匈奴岁岁无争战，白马黄驼傍草眠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6458,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"漠北词三首 其二","author":"谢榛","text":"石头敲火炙黄羊，胡女低歌劝酪浆。\n醉杀群胡不知夜，遥见岭下月如霜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6459,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"漠北词 其四","author":"谢榛","text":"晓开毡帐拥秋云，虏将挥鞭部落分。\n牧马阴山莫南向，雁门今有李将军。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6460,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"思妇吟","author":"仲春龙","text":"身在天涯梦在秦，归时未卜见时频。\n浔阳江上秋风过，传得琵琶与别人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6461,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"直中作","author":"仲春龙","text":"条风辇道起香尘，内诏传宣促五臣。\n别殿香飘黄帔揭，缠龙帖子赐宜春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6462,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宫词二首 其一","author":"仲春龙","text":"海子周遭长荻芽，春深乘舰不乘车。\n阿谁贪看游鱼戏，抛却新簪茉莉花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6463,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宫词二首 其二","author":"仲春龙","text":"晓来别院递笙歌，百子池头长绿荷。\n睡起无聊庭下立，笑拈竿子打蜂窠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6464,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"酬谢逸人四溟三首 其一","author":"卢楠","text":"曹思弄文翰，歌咏邺中诗。\n招游七才子，俱好相如词。\n君随凫雁圃，应教凤凰池。\n聊拂清霞赏，慰兹琼树枝。\n胡为泛沧海，令我长相思。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6465,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"酬谢逸人四溟三首 其二","author":"卢楠","text":"谢客恣霞想，挥手绝人群。\n朝辞北燕里，暮宿大梁云。\n海月照舞席，澄江泻清濆。\n远游憩灵境，奇节冠秋雯。\n黄鹄思烟侣，长鸣向夕曛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6466,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"酬谢逸人四溟三首 其三","author":"卢楠","text":"李白谪仙才，祢衡赋鹦鹉。\n缄愁投夜郎，掩泪赴黄祖。\n杀身扬绮芬，高名播千古。\n天摧白龙鳞，云断黄鹤羽。\n感此远谢君，沉吟望梁父。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6467,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"重赠李子理","author":"卢楠","text":"麒麟出鲁郊，商锄为不祥。\n向非孔仲尼，何异犬与羊。\n所以路傍人，按剑嘿夜光。\n近时青云士，岂无鲁连子。\n气节苟不申，甘蹈东海死。\n世人闻此言，弃之如敝屣。\n投君勿复道，北风吹易水。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":6468,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}}]